    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_14",
      "hash64": "7146FCC201AF4AC5",
      "text": "In fact, I’ve heard that all kinds of unusual\\nPokémon appear on foggy nights.\\c\\nI’m sure that the Bloodmoon Beast is one of\\nthem—it’s gotta be...[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
